{
  "schema": "nemo-control/msb-lane-image-pins/v1",
  "description": "Canonical execution-plane image-pin inventory for the sandbox/microVM lanes. Every entry declares the reference exactly as it appears in source, the pin class that binds it, and its qualification status. scripts/check-image-pins.mjs re-derives each reference from the listed source files and fails on drift or on any undeclared unpinned execution-plane default. Classes: registry-digest (immutable OCI digest), oci-manifest-bound (digest plus content verification against an embedded manifest), immutable-url-sha256 (date-pinned artifact URL plus checksum), local-operator-image (built and trusted by the operator, no upstream identity), provider-catalog-name (resolved at provision time by the provider API; not OCI-pinnable), mutable-tag (registry pullable but tag-bound; a defect unless declared), development (outside the execution plane).",
